  description: "Chi\u1EBFu b\xE0i gi\u1EA3ng sinh h\u1ECDc, \u1EA3nh t\u1EEB k\xEDnh hi\u1EC3n vi gi\xE1o vi\xEAn, c\xE2u h\u1ECFi th\u1EA3o lu\u1EADn. B\u1EA5m v\xE0o m\xE0n h\xECnh \u0111\u1EC3 sang trang."
  usage: 
--- !u!114 &2052369776
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
